    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "wallet: enforce max_tx_weight for preset inputs",
    "user": {
      "login": "gjija",
      "id": 4366099,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYwOTk=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366099?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/gjija",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "`fundrawtransaction` was not respecting `max_tx_weight` in one case.\r\n\r\nIf the provided inputs were already enough to fund the transaction, coin selection returned early. The final weight check then used the standard 400,000 WU ceiling instead of the requested `max_tx_weight`.\r\n\r\nI reproduced this with 10 legacy inputs and `max_tx_weight=4000`. Funding succeeded even though the transaction was 6,168 WU after signing. Same result with both `add_inputs=false` and `add_inputs=true`.\r\n\r\nThe fix is to use the configured max weight in the final check.\r\n\r\nFor signed transactions, it checks the actual transaction weight. For unsigned transactions, it checks the estimated signed weight.\r\n\r\nI added a regression test for both `add_inputs` settings:\r\n\r\n- `4000 WU` must fail\r\n- `8000 WU` must fund successfully\r\n- after signing, the transaction must still be within the limit\r\n\r\nThe test fails before the fix and passes after it.\r\n\r\nTested on macOS arm64:\r\n\r\n- `wallet_fundrawtransaction.py`\r\n- `wallet_send.py`\r\n- `wallet_v3_txs.py`\r\n- live regtest reproduction\r\n\r\nAll passed.",
